stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> GATE
  GATE --> BLOCKED : record chain broken, policy or selection inconsistent
  GATE --> EXPORT : gate passed
  EXPORT --> BUILD : contract checks passed
  EXPORT --> BLOCKED : contract check failed
  BUILD --> PRE_UPLOAD_CHECKS
  PRE_UPLOAD_CHECKS --> BLOCKED : secret, restricted file or removed feature found
  PRE_UPLOAD_CHECKS --> LICENCE_GATE : nothing found
  LICENCE_GATE --> DEPLOYED : every production source CLEARED
  LICENCE_GATE --> BUILT_NOT_DEPLOYED : a source is PENDING_CONFIRMATION
  BLOCKED --> [*]
  DEPLOYED --> [*]
  BUILT_NOT_DEPLOYED --> [*]
